<section class="founder-section" id="about">
  <img
    class="founder-cutout"
    src="{{ 'founder-desktop-clear.png' | asset_url }}"
    alt="Vlad Seuruk, founder of Cata-Kor"
    width="800"
    height="900"
    loading="lazy"
  >
  <div class="founder-live-inner">
    <div class="founder-story">
      <h2>LONGEVITY, MADE<br>ACCESSIBLE</h2>
      <span class="founder-quote-mark" aria-hidden="true">“</span>
      <p>When I first became obsessed with the science of longevity, I kept seeing the same pattern.</p>
      <p><b>The most interesting tools — NAD+,</b> advanced wellness protocols, clinical-style testing — were often expensive, confusing, or only available to people with access to private clinics. But healthy aging should not feel exclusive.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="founder-mission">
      <p>I started Cata-Kor to bring serious longevity support into everyday routines: products built with quality ingredients, transparent dosing, and testing standards people can trust.</p>
      <div class="founder-callout">
        <p>My goal was never to make another supplement brand. <b>It was to build a company for people who want to feel better for longer — without making longevity complicated or out of reach.</b></p>
      </div>
      <span class="founder-close-quote" aria-hidden="true">”</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="founder-attribution">
    <b>Vlad Seuruk</b>
    <span>Founder of Cata-Kor® - Americas<br>#1 NAD+ supplement brand.</span>
  </div>
</section>

